# The generated name catalog. Roland's patch names, extracted from Roland's
# own editor binary and manuals by tools/extract_catalog.py. Each user
# generates it from their own copies; rxved runs without it, showing bank,
# number, MSB, LSB and program change (all of which are this project's own
# arithmetic) and reading names from the synth on request.
#
# The sibling eosed and s3ked projects do not commit manufacturer content
# either. See README.md and CLAUDE.md.
xv/data/

